      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
        <div class="a"><p>Free and tracked. We dispatch within 1–3 working days and orders usually arrive within 7–10 days, occasionally up to 14. Delays are rare, but customs or busy periods can add a few days.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if it doesn't suit me?</summary>
        <div class="a"><p>Thirty days from delivery. Email us and we'll refund you in full. If it's a change of mind, the return postage is yours; if it's faulty, it's ours.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

